  <name>Caskade</name>
  <summary>Game library and launcher</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="sv">Spelbibliotek och spelstartare</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Caskade is a cross-platform game library and launcher that brings your PC
      games, storefronts, emulators, ROMs, and streaming clients together in one
      fast native interface for both desktop and TV.
    </p>
    <p>
      Browse and organize your collection with rich metadata, switch to a
      gamepad-first console mode on the couch, and launch games without leaving
      your library.
    </p>
  </description>
